EXCLUSIVE : Former NBA champion and All-Star David M. West is stepping into the world of filmmaking as screenwriter and executive producer of The Neighbor , a psychological thriller inspired by true events and directed by Kyle Scott.

Principal photography began November 4, 2026, in Cape Town, South Africa, where production is currently underway.

The international cast includes Myles Truitt ( Stranger Things ), Joseph Steven Yang ( G20 ), Hana Kim ( Mother/Android ), and Ghanaian Afropop and dancehall musician Stonebwoy. Related Stories News Warwick Thornton, Teona Strugar Mitevska & Myroslav Slaboshpytskiy Set For Rotterdam's Cinemart Legal Gérard Depardieu Rape Case Sent To Trial In Criminal Court After Actor Loses Appeal

West, who spent 15 seasons in the NBA and won two championships with the Golden State Warriors has scripted the project which is set in the San Francisco Bay Area. The movie follows "a veteran professional basketball player and his wife whose hopes for a peaceful new beginning unravel when an unsettling presence in their neighborhood draws them into a dangerous web of obsession, manipulation and buried secrets. As their sense of security begins to crumble, the couple discovers that the greatest threats may be hiding closer to home than they imagined." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

Kyle Scott's credits including upcoming action-comedy Boyz Trip with Rome Flynn, Algee Smith, Desi Banks and Sivuyile Ngesi. The film&#x2019;s production team includes lead producer Ama K. Abebrese ( Beasts Of No Nation ), producer Ty Walker ( Die Hart ), producer Sarsha Venord and Emmy-winning production designer Warren Gray, with David M. West, Kyle Scott and Jamez T. serving as executive producers.

The film brings together production companies across three continents, including In Peace Productions (Raleigh, North Carolina), KeyScott Entertainment (Brisbane, Australia), Blue Ice Africa (Cape Town, South Africa) and Braveheart Entertainment (Atlanta, Georgia).

West said: &#x201C;Basketball has been such a big part of my life, and I&#x2019;m grateful for the platform and opportunities it&#x2019;s given me. As I step into filmmaking, I&#x2019;m excited to expand that impact through storytelling and spark meaningful conversations. The Neighbor is a project I&#x2019;m proud to be part of, and as production continues, I look forward to collaborating with our talented team to bring this story to life and create something audiences will remember.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#x201C; The Neighbor represents an exciting evolution in my career as a filmmaker, marking my first psychological thriller and third major production in less than a year,&#x201D; added director and executive producer Kyle Scott. &#x201C;Through my collaboration with David M. West, I&#x2019;m focused on building a diverse slate of films that challenge convention, transcend cultural and geographical boundaries, and deliver powerful storytelling to audiences around the world. Great cinema has no borders.&#x201D;

Legal representation for The Neighbor is being handled by The Perry Law Group.

The International Film Festival Rotterdam ( IFFR ) Pro has unveiled the selection of 20 feature projects for the 44th edition of CineMart, its flagship co-production market, running Jan. 31-Feb. 3, as well as 10 projects for its work-in-progress platform Darkroom. And such big names as Aboriginal Australian filmmaker Warwick Thornton, Roma producer Nicol&#xE1;s Celis and North Macedonian auteur Teona Strugar Mitevska ( God Exists, Her Name Is Petrunya ) will be represented. Additionally, IFFR has shared the selected projects for the second edition of its Safe Harbour strand of CineMart for filmmakers who have experienced displacement or forced migration. IFFR Pro brings together filmmakers, producers and international industry partners around a carefully curated program of projects and opportunities. At its center is CineMart, which connects projects in development with potential partners and collaborators, alongside dedicated pathways for filmmakers supported by the Hubert Bals Fund and those participating in Safe Harbour. Darkroom extends this support to films approaching completion, while Rotterdam Lab invests in the next generation of producers and filmmakers. &#x201C;Together, these initiatives reflect IFFR's commitment to building lasting connections between artistic talent, international networks and the opportunities needed to bring distinctive cinematic visions to audiences,&#x201D; organizers said. &#x201C;Among the notable filmmakers and producers featuring at CineMart 2027 are Cam&#xE9;ra d&#x2019;Or winner Warwick Thornton, Berlinale and Lux Audience Award winner Teona Strugar Mitevska, Nicolas Celis, producer of Academy Award-winning Roma and Emilia Perez , treble Cannes Critics&#x2019; Week winner Myroslav Slaboshpytskiy, Toronto Platform Award winner Carlos Marqu&#xE9;s-Marcet and Tiger Award winner Paz F&#xE1;brega,&#x201D; IFFR Pro said. Related Stories Movies Director Cédric Klapisch to Receive César Lifetime Achievement Honor Guest Column Bowen Yang, Mark Ruffalo and the Rise of Antisemitism in Hollywood (Guest Column)

Said Marten Rabarts, head of IFFR Pro: &#x201C;From contemporary reinventions of the Western and working-class musical fables to personal and urgent stories of displacement and identity, this year&#x2019;s CineMart, Darkroom and Safe Harbour selections unites an extraordinary range of cinematic voices &#x2013; filmmakers reclaiming histories, subverting familiar genres and finding fresh ways to tell stories about our world. That we can bring together celebrated auteurs and festival alumni working in independent cinema with filmmakers embarking on their first features is something quintessentially Rotterdam. It is the strength, relevance and originality of the cinematic vision, rather than the stage of a filmmaker&#x2019;s career, that draws us to a project." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

