It's still 2026, but NBC Sports is using a stacked Thanksgiving TV lineup to tee up the 2028 summer Olympics , which will be held in Los Angeles, California.

The network is debuting a spot on today's ( surprise rebroadcast of last year's) Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade, and it will re-air on the National Dog Show Presented by Purina and in Thursday night's national NFL game between the Kansas City Chiefs and Buffalo Bills.

